<title>EGYPT: Egypt all-share index at 5th straight record close.</title>
<headline>Egypt all-share index at 5th straight record close.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's all-share index jumped 0.9 percent on Thursday to close at a fifth straight record high of 355.31 points, from 352.08 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 12 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
